        "\\caption{\n",
        "Overview of our proposed UniMS framework.\n",
        "At first, we extend BART encoder to multimodal encoder by embedding visual features with linear projection as additional input.\n",
        "To enhance the multimodal encoder's ability to understand multimodal input, we further introduce extractive text reference and image reference via knowledge distillation to guide our encoder. Besides, the proposed visual guided decoder separately attends to the visual and the textual output of the multimodal encoder.\n",
