            "Besides, they incorporate the last hidden states of the text encoder or the summary decoder into their proposed image discriminator and denote it as $\\mathrm{MOF}_{\\mathrm{enc}}$ and $\\mathrm{MOF}_{\\mathrm{dec}}$.\n",
